e to UV, weathering, salt spray, and freeze–thaw cycling. Test reports for each lot are available on request.</p><p>Dimensional control: slabs are checked for length, width, thickness tolerance, edge squareness, and corner protection. Tiles are calibrated and gauged for consistent thickness and right-angle precision. Cut-to-size pieces are checked against your project drawings before crating.</p><p>Surface finish: polished surfaces are inspected for gloss uniformity and absence of scratches; honed, flamed, bush-hammered, sandblasted, and leathered finishes are checked for texture consistency across the lot.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard-check h-5 w-5 text-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1" /><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2" /><path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4" /></svg><div class="font-display text-lg">Factory Quality Control</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2">Documented quality control across cutting, polishing, packing, and shipment.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard-check h-5 w-5 text-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1" /><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2" /><path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4" /></svg><div class="font-display text-lg">Product Inspection</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2">Each granite slab, tile, and block 