<p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2">Test reports and origin certificates available upon request.</p></div></div><p class="mt-10 text-sm text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl">Test reports, certificates of origin, fumigation certificates (ISPM-15), and pre-shipment inspection reports — including third-party inspection by SGS, Bureau Veritas, or Intertek on request — are issued per shipment. Egyptian Granite by EG does not publish certificate numbers online; please request documentation specific to your order and destination market.</p></section><!--/$--></main>
